Format: https://www.debian.org/doc/packaging-manuals/copyright-format/1.0/
Upstream-Name: trizbort-qt
Upstream-Contact: Jason Self <j@jxself.org>
Source: https://github.com/TimeGnu/trizbort
Comment:
 This package builds the Qt/C++ reimplementation of Trizbort, which lives in
 the qt/ subdirectory and is GPL-3.0-or-later. The rest of the tree is the
 original C#/.NET Trizbort, kept under its MIT (Expat) licence and not built
 here. Some qt/ files are translated from the MIT original and additionally
 credit its authors in their headers (see qt/LICENSING.md); a handful of the
 original C# files also carry GPL-3.0-or-later headers added by the port's
 author -- consult individual file headers where precision is needed.
Files-Excluded:
 PdfSharp.dll
 lib/*.dll

